SHUYU_CARD_XIANG_TAI_NING_JU.description:
Gain {energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)} for each other [gold]Retained[/gold] card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Then choose 1 [gold]Retained[/gold] card to discard.{InCombat:
(Gain {CalculatedEnergy:energyIcons()})|}

SHUYU_CARD_CHE_GU.description:
Remove ALL [gold]Artifact[/gold] from the enemy. Apply [gold]Chill[/gold].
If any [gold]Artifact[/gold] was removed, apply [gold]Chill[/gold] 1 additional time.{IfUpgraded:show:
Draw {Cards:diff()} {Cards:plural:card|cards}.}

SHUYU_CARD_JIE_JING_CUI_HUA.description:
Multiply your [gold]Ice Thorns[/gold] by {Multiple:diff()}.
For every {IceThornsPower:diff()} [gold]Ice Thorns[/gold] gained this way, take {ExtraDamage:diff()} damage.{InCombat:
(Take {CalculatedDamage} damage)|}

SHUYU_CARD_BO_WEN_GONG_ZHEN.description:
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Block[/gold] multiplied by {Multiple:diff()}.
Halve this damage for each card played this turn, up to 4 times.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}

SHUYU_CARD_JIN_SHU_NI_SHANG.description:
Restore your HP to what it was at the start of combat.{InCombat:
(Heal {HealAmount} HP.)|}
Add 2 [gold]Misfortunes[/gold] into your [gold]Draw Pile[/gold].

SHUYU_CARD_CHONG_YING_ZHEN.description:
[gold]Ice Needles[/gold] cost 1 more, become [gold]Upgraded[/gold], and gain [gold]Replay[/gold] 1.{IfUpgraded:show:
Whenever you play an [gold]Ice Needle[/gold], gain 1 [gold]Strength[/gold].}
Add {Cards:diff()} [gold]{Cards:plural:Ice Needle|Ice Needles}[/gold] into your [gold]Hand[/gold].

SHUYU_CARD_MO_LI_XIAN_DAN.description:
Deal damage equal to the total [gold]Fragile[/gold] applied this combat multiplied by {ExtraDamage:diff()}.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}
Then deal damage to ALL enemies based on the damage dealt.
